# A window seat: a walnut box bench under a back wall window, a sage cushion,
# pillows against the sill. Two tiles wide; the reader sits on the right one
# facing the viewer, and zbias -1 paints the bench before them.
sprite library-window-seat
size 32 30
layer object
footprint 2 1
origin 0 14
zbias -1
tag seat read library
spot read 1 0 down read sit

frame default
